gonna be drinking at 10 a.m.?

510
00:26:07,899 --> 00:26:08,817
Me and Mary.

511
00:26:08,900 --> 00:26:10,026
[both laugh]

512
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:12,904
Today's the open house for Fennell.
Amanza and I worked really hard

513
00:26:12,988 --> 00:26:14,155
to get everything done, and…

514
00:26:14,698 --> 00:26:17,117
keep it under the budget-ish, I guess.

515
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:19,786
And we're really excited
for Jason and Kat to see it.

516
00:26:19,869 --> 00:26:22,038
And we hope they love it
just as much as we do.

517
00:26:22,122 --> 00:26:23,832
[uptempo pop playing]

518
00:26:29,796 --> 00:26:32,132
[Amanza] Welcome to the beautiful…

519
00:26:32,924 --> 00:26:34,676
