520
00:26:34,759 --> 00:26:36,553
Have you seen it
since everything's been done?

521
00:26:36,636 --> 00:26:37,846
I haven't seen it like this.

522
00:26:37,929 --> 00:26:40,265
-[Heather] What do you think?
-I love it.

523
00:26:41,266 --> 00:26:44,144
-[Heather] Doesn't it look amazing?
-[Jason] Looks good, brings color in.

524
00:26:44,227 --> 00:26:47,230
-Yes. Good.
-[Amanza] She picked some good ones.

525
00:26:48,023 --> 00:26:50,483
[Jason] God,
kitchen looks so much better too.

526
00:26:50,567 --> 00:26:53,403
I think we spent, what, 40,000 on this?

527
00:26:53,486 --> 00:26:56,448
We probably added 240,000 in value.

528
00:26:56,531 --> 00:26:58,491
Yeah. No, it looks amazing.

529
00:26:59,868 --> 00:27:01,453
