530
00:27:04,247 --> 00:27:07,542
-Heather's gonna entertain the guests.
-[Heather] Let me play you one thing!

531
00:27:12,255 --> 00:27:14,883
-Gotta be careful on this hill.
-[Amanza] Well, hello.

532
00:27:14,966 --> 00:27:17,302
-[laughs] Well, hello.
-Hi, you guys.

533
00:27:18,970 --> 00:27:20,347
[Heather] How great, right?

534
00:27:21,514 --> 00:27:23,808
-[Maya] I love the beams.
-[Davina] Gorgeous beams, yeah.

535
00:27:24,517 --> 00:27:26,269
-Hey.
-Wow. 

536
00:27:26,519 --> 00:27:28,563
-You look spunky today.
-Thank you. 

537
00:27:28,647 --> 00:27:29,939
-Congrats.
-[Amanza] Thank you.

538
00:27:30,023 --> 00:27:31,149
Wow. It's beautiful.

539
00:27:34,402 --> 00:27:35,236
[Heather] Hi.

540
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:36,446
Hey guys. Jason.

541
00:27:37,155 --> 00:27:38,365
-Pleasure.
-Arthur.

542
00:27:38,448 --> 00:27:39,908
[Heather] Hi, how are you?

543
00:27:42,035 --> 00:27:44,120
-[Mary] Those skylights are awesome.
-They are, right?

544
00:27:44,204 --> 00:27:46,915
So there's an office,
which could be a bedroom

545
00:27:46,998 --> 00:27:49,793
because it has a bathroom over here.
There's a master…

546
00:27:50,085 --> 00:27:53,505
So the exposed beams in the ceiling,
again, like, open to the pool. 

547
