I messaged her, and she replied briefly,
so I haven't talked to her,

572
00:28:47,517 --> 00:28:49,978
-and I'm gonna give her space.
-[Davina] I messaged her too.

573
00:28:50,061 --> 00:28:51,604
Yeah, I think, um…

574
00:28:51,688 --> 00:28:54,607
Yeah, she-- I mean,
she's doing okay as she can be.

575
00:28:54,691 --> 00:28:57,610
You know, I mean, as can be expected.

576
00:28:57,694 --> 00:28:58,778
I'm still shocked, I…

577
00:28:59,529 --> 00:29:01,740
Oh my God, can you imagine?

578
00:29:01,823 --> 00:29:03,783
-[Arthur] I love the white cabinets.
-Mm-hmm.

579
00:29:03,867 --> 00:29:06,703
-You gonna head out? Are you happy?
-I'm really happy.

580
00:29:06,786 --> 00:29:08,371
-Good!
-You've done such a good job.

581
00:29:08,455 --> 00:29:10,248
-And we're gonna sell it for you.
-Thank you.

582
00:29:10,331 --> 00:29:11,458
-Yes.
-Yeah.

583
00:29:11,541 --> 00:29:13,668
-Glad you like it.
-Glad you're happy. We'll talk soon.

584
00:29:13,752 --> 00:29:14,586
-Okay.
-Bye, Kat.

585
00:29:16,129 --> 00:29:17,255
-[Heather] She's happy?
-Very.

586
00:29:17,338 --> 00:29:19,215
-And she should be.
-You guys did a good job.

587
00:29:19,299 --> 00:29:21,843
