589
00:29:23,511 --> 00:29:25,221
-Yeah.
-Well, let's sell it first.

590
00:29:25,305 --> 00:29:27,265
-You will. Definitely.
-Pinkie promise it.

591
00:29:27,348 --> 00:29:29,225
-Three and a half times?
-He pinkie-promised me!

592
00:29:29,309 --> 00:29:31,144
-I'm just saying goodbye.
-No, that is bound.

593
00:29:31,227 --> 00:29:32,395
Amanza, grab his other pinkie!

594
00:29:32,479 --> 00:29:35,064
[Jason] I was just trying
to give you my coffee to hold.

595
00:29:35,356 --> 00:29:37,650
I'm gonna get, but I'm really proud
of both of you ladies.

596
00:29:37,734 --> 00:29:40,236
-[Heather] Thank you.
-Good job. Now let's sell it.

597
00:29:41,571 --> 00:29:43,406
I had my doubts working with Amanza,

598
00:29:43,490 --> 00:29:45,825
but she totally proved herself
on this project,

599
00:29:45,909 --> 00:29:47,785
and I honestly couldn't have done it
without her.

600
00:29:47,869 --> 00:29:49,245
I think people were surprised.

601
00:29:49,329 --> 00:29:51,414
They were like,
"You-- Wait, you guys did this?"

602
00:29:51,498 --> 00:29:52,582
We didn't fight.

603
00:29:52,665 --> 00:29:56,252
We had our moment already,
and I think, like, we're so past all that.

604
00:29:56,336 --> 00:29:59,422
-That's good for the year. We did great.
-Yes! Good job, girl.

605
00:29:59,506 --> 00:30:00,757
[uptempo pop playing]

606
00:30:00,840 --> 00:30:04,511
♪ Makin' it a good time
Good time, a good time ♪

607
00:30:04,594 --> 00:30:06,721
♪ I'm hangin' with the birds ♪

608
00:30:06,804 --> 00:30:10,683
♪ Yeah I'm feelin' so fly
So fly, so fly ♪

609
00:30:12,435 --> 00:30:13,436
♪ Yeah ♪

610
00:30:15,438 --> 00:30:16,606
♪ Yeah ♪

611
00:30:17,941 --> 00:30:19,651
♪ Yeah… ♪

612
00:30:24,906 --> 00:30:25,740
[Chrishell] Hey.

613
00:30:30,995 --> 00:30:32,622
-Hey.
-Hey!

614
00:30:35,291 --> 00:30:37,627
-[Jason] Good to see you.
-Good to see you too.

615
00:30:38,628 --> 00:30:41,297
-Um, can I talk to you for a second?
-Yeah, of course.

616
00:30:42,298 --> 00:30:43,174
[Chrishell sighs]

617
00:30:47,637 --> 00:30:52,100
Uh, so I was just wondering if…
It's so much craziness.

618
00:30:52,183 --> 00:30:55,353
Um, if it's okay, I think
I'm gonna go home for a little bit.

619
00:30:56,479 --> 00:30:59,566
And kind of, I don't know,
make sense of everything.

620
00:30:59,649 --> 00:31:01,067
So I was hoping I could…

621
00:31:02,068 --> 00:31:04,404
get out of town
and go see my family and stuff.

622
00:31:05,071 --> 00:31:06,990
Take as much time off as you need. 

623
