I cannot imagine what you're dealing with,
so…

624
00:31:10,910 --> 00:31:14,122
Yeah, take what you need.
You know, we're gonna be here for you.

625
00:31:14,205 --> 00:31:15,039
I'm gonna…

626
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:19,878
just figure this out, I don't know, um…

627
00:31:19,961 --> 00:31:22,505
-Listen, I'll cover all of your work.
-[Chrishell] Thank you.

628
00:31:22,589 --> 00:31:24,299
Just send me
whatever you need me to cover.

629
00:31:24,382 --> 00:31:26,384
-[sighs] Thank you.
-[Jason] And honestly, 

630
00:31:26,467 --> 00:31:28,553
take the time you need. I mean,

631
