644
00:32:05,715 --> 00:32:07,634
And look, I won't ask any questions.

645
00:32:07,717 --> 00:32:10,845
Just want you to know that--
that we're there for you.

646
00:32:10,928 --> 00:32:13,264
Thank you. I do want them to know, like,

647
00:32:13,348 --> 00:32:16,476
I really appreciate them
being so sweet and nice.

648
00:32:16,559 --> 00:32:17,560
It's just I haven't…

649
00:32:18,061 --> 00:32:19,520
When you see them, tell them.

650
00:32:19,604 --> 00:32:20,980
-[Jason] I will.
-I appreciate that.

651
00:32:21,064 --> 00:32:23,358
They're just concerned. Obviously.
We all are.

652
00:32:23,441 --> 00:32:26,235
I wanna just let them know
that you're okay.

653
00:32:26,653 --> 00:32:29,489
You know, I'm sure
you're probably not okay in some ways,

654
00:32:29,572 --> 00:32:31,115
but I know that you will be okay.

655
00:32:31,199 --> 00:32:33,368
That's how I feel.
I feel like I'm not okay,

656
00:32:33,743 --> 00:32:35,203
but that I will be okay.

657
00:32:36,371 --> 00:32:37,580
-So…
-I'll take that.

658
00:32:38,039 --> 00:32:38,915
[door opens]

659
00:32:43,795 --> 00:32:46,214
-[Mary] How are you?
-Oh.

660
00:32:46,297 --> 00:32:47,465
[Mary] Good to see you.

661
00:32:49,634 --> 00:32:51,010
Hey, I'm sorry.

662
00:32:52,053 --> 00:32:53,429
-Thanks for the flowers.
-Of course.

663
00:32:53,513 --> 00:32:55,431
You both are so sweet, thank you.

664
00:32:56,599 --> 00:32:59,769
[Jason] Well, she's gonna take time off,
see some family.

665
00:32:59,852 --> 00:33:00,687
Yeah.

666
