have your family to support you and stuff.

667
00:33:06,317 --> 00:33:08,194
-Yeah.
-[Heather] Just get away from everything.

668
00:33:08,319 --> 00:33:11,155
-[Jason] Yeah, like, turn your phone off.
-[Mary] Mm-hmm.

669
