That's why I feel--
I was telling Jason to please say-- hey!

670
00:33:15,576 --> 00:33:17,328
-[Jason] Hey, Amanza.
-…to let everyone know

671
00:33:17,412 --> 00:33:21,249
everyone's just been so sweet.
I haven't really been responsive, but…

672
00:33:22,125 --> 00:33:23,626
[Amanza] Aw, love you.

673
00:33:25,795 --> 00:33:28,965
-[Amanza] Are you eating?
-I just am not hungry. Yeah.

674
00:33:30,007 --> 00:33:31,759
-It's a lot of stress.
-[Jason] Hey, Maya.

675
00:33:32,301 --> 00:33:34,971
-[all] Hi, Maya.
-[Chrishell] I should get outta here…

676
00:33:35,054 --> 00:33:38,558
I don't know how stable I am,
seeing everybody, but…

677
00:33:39,434 --> 00:33:40,601
Hey.

678
00:33:42,395 --> 00:33:43,646
-[Chrishell] Hi.
-How you doing?

679
00:33:43,730 --> 00:33:45,148
How are you feeling?

680
00:33:45,231 --> 00:33:46,816
-Oh, man.
-I've been better.

681
00:33:47,525 --> 00:33:49,777
-Hi.
-You look so good.

682
00:33:49,861 --> 00:33:50,903
[Chrishell] Thanks.

683
00:33:51,404 --> 00:33:52,822
[Chrishell sighs]

684
00:33:52,905 --> 00:33:54,574
[Heather] We don't want to bombard you 

685
00:33:54,657 --> 00:33:57,326
-with questions and…
-[Chrishell] Yeah--

686
00:33:57,410 --> 00:33:59,120
Just wanna make sure you're okay,
and…

687
00:33:59,203 --> 00:34:02,081
I know. I'm sorry, I can't really--
It's too soon to, like…

688
00:34:02,957 --> 00:34:05,752
-talk about everything 'cause I'm trying--
-[Jason] No, don't.

689
00:34:05,835 --> 00:34:08,212
…keep it together. But I do wanna say

690
00:34:08,296 --> 00:34:11,924
I really appreciate everybody
being really sweet and reaching out.

691
00:34:12,008 --> 00:34:15,344
I'm just gonna go
and spend some time with family and…

692
00:34:16,596 --> 00:34:17,847
