693
00:34:18,598 --> 00:34:20,558
Guys, let's give Chrishell a group hug.

694
00:34:20,641 --> 00:34:22,894
-[all] Aww.
-You need some love now.

695
00:34:23,519 --> 00:34:24,645
[Heather] We love you.

696
00:34:26,981 --> 00:34:28,065
Thank you.

697
00:34:31,069 --> 00:34:31,944
Thank you, guys.

698
00:34:32,028 --> 00:34:35,698
-[Jason] I'll let you go.
-Appreciate it. Um, I'll be back.

699
00:34:36,574 --> 00:34:37,867
-Travel safe.
-Okay. Thank you.

700
00:34:37,950 --> 00:34:39,577
-Love you, honey.
-[Jason] Bye, Chrishell.

701
00:34:41,871 --> 00:34:44,081
Okay, honestly, guys, she lost 15 pounds.

702
00:34:44,165 --> 00:34:45,917
I'm not even kidding.

703
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,418
-[Maya] You okay?
-Yeah.

704
00:34:50,129 --> 00:34:52,590
It, like, just--
It really just makes me so--

705
00:34:53,091 --> 00:34:55,718
[inhales] so sad to see her like that.

706
00:34:56,177 --> 00:34:57,178
["Hold On" playing]

707
00:34:57,261 --> 00:34:59,347
♪ Everything you need to know ♪

708
00:34:59,430 --> 00:35:03,643
♪ You think you've got
Everything under control ♪

709
00:35:03,726 --> 00:35:05,978
I just feel terrible for her.

710
00:35:06,687 --> 00:35:08,397
She just doesn't deserve it.

711
00:35:08,898 --> 00:35:09,941
She doesn't.

712
00:35:11,818 --> 00:35:13,820
♪ Sinking like a stone ♪

713
00:35:17,490 --> 00:35:19,826
♪ So hold on ♪

714
00:35:19,909 --> 00:35:23,788
